          "text": "Where The Time Goes",
          "ink": "accent"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Redis: single-threaded command executor over RESP",
            "Every command costs one RTT: send, block, read reply",
            "Latency dominates, not CPU — exec is ~1µs per command",
            "Naive client throughput ceiling ≈ 1/RTT, whatever Redis does"
          ]
        },
